OL,3,GNEWSACanterbury's Bayeux Tapestry role
OL,4,Aexplored in play
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mystery over exactly where the
OL,7,FBayeux Tapestry was created, and who
OL,8,Fby, has been turned into a play which
OL,9,Fpremiered in Kent on Thursday.
OL,11,FIt has long been believed that the
OL,12,Ftapestry, which is currently on show at
OL,13,Fthe British Museum in London and tells
OL,14,Fthe story of the Norman conquest of
OL,15,FEngland and the Battle of Hastings in
OL,16,F1066, was stitched in England in the
OL,17,F11th Century.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
